    - rid: 5184086490568459199
      type: {class: ExplainStep, ns: VRSprayPainting, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        title: 
        body: "Spray paint is toxic and flammable. The fine mist gets into your lungs
          and eyes.\n\nReal painters always:\n\u2022 wear a respirator rated for
          paint and safety goggles\n\u2022 spray with ventilation (booth extraction
          fan, or outdoors)\n\u2022 clean and mask the part before painting\n\nLet's
          get ready."
        buttonLabel: Start
    - rid: 5184086490568459200
      type: {class: SafetyStep, ns: VRSprayPainting, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        instruction: 'Get ready like a real painter:'
        resetGear: 1
